From: Kestrel OS port <local>
Subject: [PATCH, DIAGNOSTIC, LOCAL-ONLY] re-enable gem_noc on Slim 3

Rationale: dwc3's apps-usb icc path runs gem->config_noc, so the
0007 disable stalls USB forever (no rootfs, black hang after mount
timeout). Re-enable gem alone; if the 0.51s reset returns, gem was
the crasher and USB needs another route. NOT for publication or
general ARM64 support.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-ideapad-slim3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x126100-lenovo-ideapad-slim3.dts
@@ -1746,3 +1746,10 @@
 &scm {
 	/delete-property/ interconnects;
 };
+
+/* DIAGNOSTIC 2026-10-16 (0010): re-enable gem_noc. dwc3's apps-usb
+ * icc path runs gem->config_noc, so the 0007 disable stalls USB
+ * forever (no rootfs). If the 0.51s reset returns, gem was the
+ * crasher and USB needs another route. Local-only, not for
+ * publication. */
+&gem_noc { status = "okay"; };
